{
  "id": "comparatives-1",
  "level": "A2",
  "title": "Komparative und Superlative",
  "group": "Adjectives",
  "sourceFile": "kompsuper1.html",
  "overview": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "Comparative: adjective + -er. Superlative: am … -sten or der/die/das … -ste. Umlaut often appears on a/o/u in one-syllable adjectives."
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "content": "groß → größer → am größten\ngut → besser → am besten\nviel → mehr → am meisten"
      },
      {
        "type": "example",
        "de": "Berlin ist größer als München.",
        "note": "comparative + als"
      }
    ]
  },
